## Limitations

- Differential Privacy uses a simplified DP-SGD style mechanism (gradient clipping + Gaussian noise). It does **not** provide a formally computed privacy budget (ε).
- Hospitals are **simulated** from a single public dataset, not real multi-institution data.
- Evaluation currently reports accuracy only.

